{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"库存基础与建模","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inventory-models","title":"库存模型：EOQ、新闻贩子与基础库存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/fundamentals/inventory-models","wordCount":2088,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"demand-forecasting-overview","title":"需求预测方法概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/fundamentals/demand-forecasting-overview","wordCount":1988,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"safety-stock-service-level","title":"安全库存与服务水平","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/fundamentals/safety-stock-service-level","wordCount":2179,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"库存基础与建模\">库存基础与建模</h1><p>库存理论的核心是在<strong>持有成本</strong>和<strong>缺货成本</strong>之间寻找最优平衡。本章建立三个基础模型——经济订货量（EOQ）、新闻贩子模型和基础库存策略——并推导安全库存与服务水平的量化关系，为后续章节的工程实现奠定数学基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>内容概要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><a href=\"inventory-models\">库存模型</a></td>\n<td>EOQ/新闻贩子/基础库存策略原理与适用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><a href=\"demand-forecasting-overview\">需求预测方法概述</a></td>\n<td>预测方法全景图、误差指标、方法选择框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><a href=\"safety-stock-service-level\">安全库存与服务水平</a></td>\n<td>安全库存公式推导、CSL vs Fill Rate、参数标定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}